<p class="text-center text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
  Tasks belong to initiatives, and each initiative has a contact person who answers questions about its work. Browse the
  open tasks, read what each one needs, and sign up for the ones that fit your time and skills.
</p>

<%= render Gustwave::HorizontalLine.new(class: "w-64 h-1 rounded-sm") do |line| %>
  <% line.with_visual_svg do %>
    <%= render Gustwave::Icon.new(:quote, theme: :solid, class: "-m-1 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300") %>
  <% end %>
<% end %>

<p class="text-center text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400">
  Once you have signed up, the contact person is notified and gets in touch about the next steps.
</p>
